# Base URL of the FastAPI backend. No trailing slash.
#
# Local development:
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
#
# Production: set this in the Vercel dashboard (Settings → Environment Variables) to
#   https://api.inhibiepdt.com
# If it is left unset, a production build falls back to that same origin rather than to
# localhost — see src/lib/api.ts. Set it anyway: the fallback is a safety net, not a
# configuration strategy, and it has to be changed in source if the API ever moves.
